{
  "_comment": "Frozen from projects/scara-robotics/project.json (Commons pin at the time of writing). The landing CI checks out no submodules, so hero-sweep.test.ts reads this copy; when the Commons is checked out, the same test also checks this copy still matches it.",
  "slug": "scara-robotics",
